  "description": "Gi-Ju is highly competent, but when it comes to love, she always seems to choose the wrong guy. This time, she thought things would be different. But again her faith is betrayed, and during a heated argument, she ends up falling down a flight of stairs. When she awakens in the hospital, she starts seeing suspicious ‘relationship reviews’ of others! ‘Love reviews written by their former exes…?’ \n\nCould this strange phenomenon be able to save Gi-Ju’s love life? \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)\n\n*Note: Part of YLAB's Red String Universe.*",
